            "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
          }
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "Testing confirms whether ideas work",
            "es": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]",
            "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
          },
          "quality": "good",
          "response": {
            "en": "Confirmation is part of it, but more importantly, testing allows falsification—proving ideas wrong...",
            "es": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]",
            "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
          }
        }
      ]
